000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. AIDCALC.
000300* BATCH GENERAL EDUCATION AID CALCULATION
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000600 FILE-CONTROL.
000700     SELECT DISTRICT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISTIN
000800         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
000900     SELECT PAYMENT-FILE ASSIGN TO PAYOUT
001000         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 FILE SECTION.
001300 FD  DISTRICT-FILE.
001400 COPY AIDREC.
001500 FD  PAYMENT-FILE.
001600 01  PAYMENT-LINE              PIC X(80).
001700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001800 01  WS-EOF                    PIC X VALUE 'N'.
001900     88  END-OF-FILE             VALUE 'Y'.
002000 01  WS-RATE                   PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 7138.00.
002100 01  WS-COUNT                  PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
002200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002300 0000-MAIN SECTION.
002400 0000-START.
002500     OPEN INPUT DISTRICT-FILE
002600          OUTPUT PAYMENT-FILE
002700     PERFORM 1000-READ-DISTRICT
002800     PERFORM 2000-CALC-AID UNTIL END-OF-FILE
002900     CALL 'AIDAUDIT' USING WS-COUNT
003000     CLOSE DISTRICT-FILE PAYMENT-FILE
003100     GOBACK.
003200 1000-READ-DISTRICT.
003300     READ DISTRICT-FILE
003400         AT END SET END-OF-FILE TO TRUE
003500     END-READ.
003600 2000-CALC-AID.
003700     COMPUTE AID-TOTAL-AMOUNT = AID-STUDENT-COUNT * WS-RATE
003800         * (1 + AID-ADJUST-PCT / 100)
